  "description": "Live data in MgSoftDev.KnowledgeHub pages, powered by Scriban. Pages marked as dynamic get their {{ … }} placeholders filled when displayed, so documentation that lists things which change — system roles, plant equipment, anything behind an API — stops being a copy somebody has to remember to update. Runs in a hardened sandbox with loop, recursion, output and time limits. Optional: register it to enable templates, or implement IKnowledgeHubTemplateRenderer yourself.",
